        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>Values are in default units unless otherwise noted. See Parameters dashboard.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
        <alt-text>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>A bar chart summarizing the difference in total transport cost, vehicle-distance traveled, fuel burn, and CO2 emissions for each scenario relative to the first listed scenario.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </alt-text>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
