      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Size &amp; Utilization of Facilities</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <alt-text>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>A map of facility locations with pie charts as marks. The size of the mark represents the facility&apos;s total capacity, while a slice indicates the percentage of that capacity utilized in the optimal solution.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </alt-text>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='facilities_merge (in fGDB)' name='federated.0w6r3991xjsayc1h2x9ss08urjyr' />
