            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>&gt;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <alt-text>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>A map of optimized freight flow. It uses color-coded lines to represent different transportation modes (e.g., road, rail, water, pipeline), scenario, or commodity depending on the user-selected symbology. Lines have varying thicknesses to indicate the volume of freight moving along each network segment.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </alt-text>
      </layout-options>
